{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50356","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 九、瑟瑟咏[二○] · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 九、瑟瑟咏[二○]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑟瑟焦山下，悠悠采几年。\n爲珠悬宝髻[二一]，作璞间金钿。\n色入青霄里，光浮黑碛边。\n世人偏重此，谁念楚材贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}